---
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<section class="book" id="randevu">
  <div class="book-inner">
    <p class="mono">Randevu</p>
    <h2>Yaz, konuşalım.</h2>
    <p>Ne yaptırmak istediğini, nereye düşündüğünü birkaç cümleyle yaz, varsa örnek bir görsel ekle. Müsait günleri ve fiyatı konuşuruz.</p>
    <a class="ring-btn" href={site.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor aria-label="WhatsApp üzerinden randevu al">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="92" stroke-width="2"></circle>
        <circle cx="101" cy="99" r="87" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="380 200"></circle>
        <circle cx="99" cy="101" r="82" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="300 260"></circle>
      </svg>
      <span>Randevu al<small>WhatsApp</small></span>
    </a>
    <div class="contact">
      <a href={site.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp <b>{site.phone}</b></a>
      <a href={site.instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram <b>@{site.instagram}</b></a>
      <a href={site.phoneUrl}>Telefon <b>{site.phone}</b></a>
    </div>
    <p class="note">{site.name} · {site.location}</p>
  </div>
</section>
